                "description": "Don-Jo 1486 Roller Bumper. These  4-1/2 inch roller bumpers are used in situations where 2 doors meet each other at right angles (hit each other back to back). Normally it is screwed to one of the doors at the top. After installation when both doors are open, the roller wheel will protect the doors and their hardware. Constructed of heavy duty solid cast brass in your choice of 3 finish colors. Packaged complete with mounting hardware.",
